    },
    {
      "id": "2122158663960039839",
      "text": "Tristan Jarry looked ready to rough up Michael Bunting after Bunting kept digging under Jarry's pads to try and find the puck. A big commotion in front of Edmonton's net, but no penalties handed out.",
      "url": "https://x.com/SGNolan/status/2122158663960039839",
      "published": "2026-11-16T02:43:47+00:00",
      "likes": 5,
      "author": "Siobhan Nolan",
