      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122158598616985806",
      "text": "Oilers not too happy with Bunting crashing into Jarry from behind there with the extra digs, and then Jarry himself throws Bunting to the ice himself Former Penguin on former Penguin crime!",
      "url": "https://x.com/ByJonBailey/status/2122158598616985806",
