      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2110244500475879424/yK0QpIQo_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Flyers getting *another* power play for a delay of game That would've been a good thing before, but tonight we're back to the norm of the last few years",
      "quoted_author": "Jonathan Bailey",
      "quoted_handle": "ByJonBailey"
    },
    {
      "id": "2122157626121183248",
      "text": "Owen Michaels sits for delay of game by sending the puck over the glass. Powerplay number 6 for the #Flyers tonight.",
      "url": "https://x.com/SGNolan/status/2122157626121183248",
