      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122157619855130943",
      "text": "Edmonton with their second delay of game penalty will give the Flyers a chance to erase that Konecny mistake with a PP. The bad news: the Flyers are 0-for-5 tonight with the man advantage.",
      "url": "https://x.com/charlieo_conn/status/2122157619855130943",
      "published": "2026-11-16T02:39:39+00:00",
      "likes": 19,
      "author": "Charlie O'Connor",
