      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122157143814230023",
      "text": "Konecny passed that literally right to Draisaitl, too. Just horrible at the start of the period like that, unforced.",
      "url": "https://x.com/ByJonBailey/status/2122157143814230023",
      "published": "2026-11-16T02:37:45+00:00",
      "likes": 4,
      "author": "Jonathan Bailey",
      "handle": "ByJonBailey",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2110244500475879424/yK0QpIQo_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122157111425872382",
      "text": "And Leon Draisaitl scores on a breakaway to make it 4-2. Bad turnover by Travis Konecny trying to get the puck to Sanheim up at the point leading to the breakaway.",
      "url": "https://x.com/charlieo_conn/status/2122157111425872382",
      "published": "2026-11-16T02:37:37+00:00",
      "likes": 27,
      "author": "Charlie O'Connor",
      "handle": "charlieo_conn",
