      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122157105713127609",
      "text": "Konecny just leaves Sanheim out to dry on a back pass with Draisaitl barring down on him... break-away and 4-2 Oilers",
